  "body": "mkinney's `claimed:` comment on #131 was never applied: they're now a collaborator, and step 4 skipped every OWNER/MEMBER/COLLABORATOR comment. The filter now takes claim comments from anyone except the owner account (agents post as the owner, so they stay excluded). The already-applied check keeps a self-labelled collaborator's claim silent.\n\nChangelog: none\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
